	(text "MCLP ADC card, reference design. Eight AD7190 channels on one FMC LPC card for the ZC702.\nChannel k (sheet CHk) is load cell k, converter U(k+1)01, DOUTk. Group A = CH0..CH3, group B = CH4..CH7.\nIn each sheet a dashed box holds one chip, wired to its resistors and capacitors; boxes connect\nthrough net labels: pins and wires with the same label are connected."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30 120 0)
		(effects
